   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "CHARACTER ARC\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 5, CC 17 to 32\n   1 Arc stage\n   2 Role in the scene\n   3 Dramatic role\n   4 Which way they change\n   5 The lie they believe\n   6 The old wound\n   7 Fighting the change\n   8 The test\n   9 Slipping back\n  10 How the change shows\n  11 suite: Growing up\n  12 suite: The fall\n  13 suite: The steady one\n  14 suite: Refuses to change\n  15 suite: The mirror ending\n  16 suite: Mentor at their best\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 5, CC 33 to 43\n   1 pair: When the lie is exposed, the crisis comes\n   2 pair: When the old wound is touched, they fight the change harder\n   3 pair: When the test is passed, the change shows\n   4 pair: When they slip back, their road drops\n   5 pair: When they fight the change with jokes, the laughs rise\n   6 pair: When the change comes, the posture opens\n   7 pair: When a character becomes the spark in a scene, the plot takes a turn\n   8 pair: When someone is set up as the lead's opposite, the lead's flaw becomes obvious\n   9 pair: When a character is growing, the change starts to show on the outside\n  10 pair: When a character is falling, they slip back into old habits\n  11 pairs: The arc engine"
   },
